if I didn't share it with you? What kind of host would I be

00:00:46.009 --> 00:00:49.178
we should see everything. if we're actually here, You're right,

00:00:52.181 --> 00:00:53.558
Thanks, Johnny, we owe you one.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.853
to help out a fellow rodent. My pleasure. Always happy

